{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Nezha Legend&quot; is a very distinctive game. After players enter the game, they can choose their game characters and set their names. The interface includes a treasure chest, a skin store, and a task function. It also introduces the data of the weapons in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After starting the game, we enter a place similar to a lobby. Many enemies will gradually enter the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can pick up the weapons dropped on the ground to fight against the enemies. They can also observe the situation on the map and go to pick up the special supplies that are airdropped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only that, players can also use two special skills to cooperate with their tactical battles and perform high-level operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The coins obtained after completing the game can be used to buy skins and open treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345530?t=1742820989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345530/9dd26d457fd3643f4575aa3ba35c4b5471721584/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742820989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345530/f652b44fbf37e3fcb06e76ffd0a02c1a2fcf4878/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742820989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345530/f652b44fbf37e3fcb06e76ffd0a02c1a2fcf4878/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742820989","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Nezha Legend&quot; is a very distinctive game. After players enter the game, they can choose their game characters and set their names. The interface includes a treasure chest, a skin store, and a task function. It also introduces the data of the weapons in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After starting the game, we enter a place similar to a lobby. Many enemies will gradually enter the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can pick up the weapons dropped on the ground to fight against the enemies. They can also observe the situation on the map and go to pick up the special supplies that are airdropped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only that, players can also use two special skills to cooperate with their tactical battles and perform high-level operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The coins obtained after completing the game can be used to buy skins and open treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u54ea\u5412\u4f20\u8bf4"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345530/e8b89dba983dc06908869128346c9276447f2583/header.jpg?t=1742820989","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117979,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117979/movie480.mp4?t=1742820987","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117979/movie_max.mp4?t=1742820987"},"name":"nzcs","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117979/f9ccc2e039eb867264bebfe3693a3d756ac1236c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742820987","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117979/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742820987","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117979/mo